an>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           处理方式：酒花厌氧蜜处理 IPA Anaerobic Honey ‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           风味：柚子、荔枝、绿葡萄、梨、酒花\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           Pomelo, Lychee, Green grape, Pear, Hops\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 41, 65);font-weight: bold;\">\n           特征关键词：黄色柑橘核果+酒花香料感+多汁\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n          蜜处理比日晒更干净清澈，它的干净是入口你能很容易辨识到所有的风味，特别是香气部分，像柚子（特别像马甲柚的那种多汁清甜），还有荔枝和绿葡萄的清甜果味，还有梨，它们都不是说多么的具象直给，但我相信你喝到了就会感受到我的意思了～哈哈哈～温度下来酒花的气味就比较明显出来了，是那种干酒花的低浓度香气；\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TAWWsbN3mr1FLZttGiavtib4yTF4pjQYW9PP6RnwcvH1mibJmJicBoSGVdyDibqR46cJ9NjN0Rq3Cflmg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n<span>\n           图片来源：CAFE IMPORTS，Quindio浅绿色位于中部\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            关于养豆、储存与冲煮\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            关于景秀\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<span>\n           Campo Hermoso处于哥伦比亚中部，海拔1800-1850米，土壤中含有大量的火山物质和高海拔，给咖啡树提供了浓郁风味物质和出色的甜味；\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SsIHOhunNPvbNdyEmluJnQXaETYhfIK2XzpR6vwpb7pxZFib22BmTkicPIa5oKbaT4iarKNJgJYFj5Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span>\n           Edwin已经在咖啡生产领域工作了20多年，在Campo Hermoso「景秀庄园」种植Heirloom原生种、Cenicafe 1、Gesha瑰夏、Yellow Bourbon黄波旁和Red Bourbon红波旁。为了生产优质咖啡，他凭着自己对咖啡发酵方面的深厚经验，利用咖啡樱桃在处理中自身产生的粘液创新加工方式—Mossto处理。\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SsIHOhunNPvbNdyEmluJnQTPfibiaWQN3glElC0TLics7VHcvEUe4FacP25HfQicCCmyicOZ7wd9eNBBg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span>\n           Edwin非常兴奋，因为他用这样全新的加工方式，发挥出了瑰夏品种强烈而杰出的味道：新鲜，水果，花香，充满活力的高品质高酸质和足够的甜感，优雅而顺滑。\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SsIHOhunNPvbNdyEmluJnQWj2K6ogeZlDwktOiacR2dmibsBABtuQRWLodRcS3ABlyvdObMC7PWviaA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           关于本批次（厌氧日晒）处理方式：\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n             采摘红果，浮选去除瑕疵果和异物等；\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n             筛选后的咖啡红果放入发酵桶，静置厌氧发酵292小时\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n             加入发酵液发酵48小时\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n             晒床缓慢晾晒干燥\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n             到达目标含水率后收入麻袋中，放置在仓库中静置1个月\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SsIHOhunNPvbNdyEmluJnQTPfibiaWQN3glElC0TLics7VHcvEUe4FacP25HfQicCCmyicOZ7wd9eNBBg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           关于酒花厌氧蜜处理过程：\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n             采摘红果，Brix大于18%，浮选\n            </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n             筛选后的红果放入发酵罐，静置厌氧发酵72小时\n            </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n             收集发酵产生的发酵液mosto\n            </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n             脱皮，最大程度的保留果胶，同时脱皮产生的汁水（果皮果胶粘液）也收集起来；用这部分汁水与研碎的酒花还有酿酒酵母菌混合一起\n            </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n             将脱皮后的咖啡豆（带着果胶）浸泡在混合后的发酵液中静置发酵（目前还没有发酵时长信息）\n            </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n             晾晒\n            </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<span>\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7StU52x4JyZiakAYzCTibTMXT4x3jnZxym54jEfXohgkDiaTia3ia8QG4tIMWrB3D5c4y7Abn80uxbdPQA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span>\n           公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span>\n           客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
